VirtualMode||||||
dev_endpoints|Device endpoints number|||1|9|
Host_channels|Host Channels|||1|16|
phy_itface_host|Physical interface|Host configuration||||
phy_itface|Physical interface|Device configuration||||
dma_enable|Enable internal IP DMA|Device configuration||||
dma_enable_host|Enable internal IP DMA|Host configuration||||
