Sof_enable_host|Signal start of frame|Host configuration||||
lpm_enable|Link Power Management|Device configuration||||
low_power_enable|Low power|Device configuration||||
speed|Speed|Device configuration||||
speed_host|Speed|Host configuration||||
low_power_enable_host|Low power|Host configuration||||
vbus_sensing_enable|VBUS sensing|Device configuration||||
vbus_sensing_enable_host|VBUS sensing|||||
use_dedicated_ep1|Use dedicated end point 1 interrupt|Device configuration||||
use_external_vbus|Use external vbus|||||

