speed|HCD_SPEED_HIGH|High Speed 480MBit/s
speed|PCD_SPEED_HIGH|High Speed 480MBit/s
speed|PCD_SPEED_HIGH_IN_FULL|Full Speed High 12MBit/s
speed|PCD_SPEED_FULL|Full Speed 1.5MBit/s
